      "title": "Max Estates to enter Delhi housing mkt with 84 acre land deal in Najafgarh",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/max-estates-to-enter-delhi-housing-mkt-with-84-acre-land-deal-in-najafgarh-126082900466_1.html",
